  "id": "hard-problem",
  "term": "hard problem",
  "definition": "In this source, the hard problem is the challenge of explaining subjective experience, including qualia and intentionality, in a way that is not fully reduced to brain processes. It is discussed as a question about whether consciousness is primary and foundational rather than something that emerges from matter.",
